      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/202607040503175129_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/202607040503175129_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/202607040503175129_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/match1867439date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">五星巴西止步16强！挪威2-1送巴西出局 哈兰德双响内马尔点射</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260706/zhanbao_image_1867439_1783288966_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260706/zhanbao_image_1867439_1783288966_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260706/zhanbao_image_1867439_1783288966_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>哈兰德双响！内马尔补时点射，吉马良斯失点，恩德里克失单刀；挪威将战英格兰vs墨西哥胜者。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a92d386123native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">桑巴军团回家！巴西遭挪威淘汰，近36年来首次世界杯16强即出局</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4ae4a553a80.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4ae4a553a80.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4ae4a553a80.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯16强对决，挪威淘汰巴西，挺进世界杯8强！五星巴西，本届就此止步16强阶段！这也是近36年来，巴西首次在世界杯16强阶段就宣告出局。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a9f74134b0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">维京海盗创历史！挪威淘汰巴西首进世界杯8强，刷新队史最佳战绩</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4ad8e5cc2fa.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4ad8e5cc2fa.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4ad8e5cc2fa.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯16强对决，挪威淘汰巴西，挺进世界杯8强！挪威在送桑巴军团回家的同时，进入8强也刷新了他们的世界杯历史最佳战绩。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4ad30447781native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">激烈！世界杯射手榜：哈兰德双响，7球追平姆巴佩、梅西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060600293017.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060600293017_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060600293017_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/8决赛，挪威2-1战胜巴西，哈兰德梅开二度。本场过后，哈兰德本届世界杯进球来到7个，追平姆巴佩、梅西。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a895616c0enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">淘汰巴西！挪威挺进世界杯8强，7月12日05:00战英格兰/墨西哥胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4410a77373c_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4410a77373c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4410a77373c.jpg"> </div><p>挪威的对手，将是英格兰与墨西哥之间的胜者，挪威的下场比赛将在北京时间7月12日05：00打响。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4ad11d1f35fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一己之力！哈兰德双响淘汰巴西 连续2场淘汰赛制胜，本届4场7球！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4adadfc2c4f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4adadfc2c4f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4adadfc2c4f.jpg"> </div><p>巴西vs挪威最后阶段，哈兰德梅开二度，本届4场打入7球！哈兰德小组赛2场梅开二度，末轮未登场，淘汰赛连续2场打入制胜球！本届世界杯开赛前，哈兰德已经在挪威连续10场破门，现在他将连续进球的场次扩大至14场！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4ad6cf70a1dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最后一舞！内马尔本届世界杯仅出战37分钟，4次参赛15场9球4助</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4adbdd783d1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4adbdd783d1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4adbdd783d1.jpg"> </div><p>巴西止步16强，34岁内马尔完成最后一舞，截至目前共为巴西队出战四届世界杯，共计出场15次，打进9球助攻4次。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a9f640d443native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">41岁C罗确认：这是我最后一届世界杯 但愿明天不是最后一场世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.85" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060701251367.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060701251367.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060701251367.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯淘汰赛，葡萄牙将战西班牙，赛前C罗出席了新闻发布会，并表示本届世界杯是他的最后一届世界杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4aa1113f8a8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">看点拉满！C罗赛前：谈退役、夺冠、人生哲学、阿根廷 当面怼记者</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a8c679b017native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：美国前锋巴洛贡可出战比利时，红牌禁赛处罚暂缓一年执行</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.41" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45c029d3709.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.41" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.41" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45c029d3709.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45c029d3709.jpg"> </div><p>FIFA官方公告，美国前锋巴洛贡可出战比利时，红牌禁赛处罚暂缓一年执行。此前世界杯1/16决赛，美国vs波黑。第64分钟，巴洛贡蹬踏穆哈雷莫维奇脚踝，VAR介入，主裁看回放后出示红牌。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a947611f67native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴洛贡停赛延缓！特朗普：感谢FIFA做了正确的事，纠正了重大不公</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="3.89" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060134023722.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="3.89" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="3.89" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060134023722_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/202607060134023722_720.jpg"> </div><p>FIFA官方公告，美国前锋巴洛贡可出战比利时，红牌禁赛处罚暂缓一年执行。对此，美国总统特朗普在社媒表达对国际足联此决定的认可。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4a971aa3746native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：白宫直接致电FIFA要求重审巴洛贡红牌，FIFA坚称未受影响</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4ab38e0137cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：特朗普周三致电因凡蒂诺，要求他复核对巴洛贡的禁赛处罚</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-06/6a4aaeb028af1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴洛贡禁赛暂缓！比利时足协：对FIFA决定感到震惊，这与规程不符</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45c117eba1b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点